  <item>
    <title>Ep13. 咱也挺不熟的，能不能有点分寸感？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c2c089db5e6d6bf94b1ca3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c2c089db5e6d6bf94b1ca3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Aug 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>/“这人好没分寸感啊”——这句话往往出现在当我们被冒犯，但好像还没到起冲突（想打人）时的一种微妙的、对与他人社交时的距离感受。分寸感一定有「相对距离」，但可能并没有「绝对距离」，每个人手里那把分寸感之尺的刻度都不尽相同。希望这期节目你也感同身受，同时能解答你的某些困惑_.</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/本期你将听到如下内容_.</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 两位主播分寸感拿捏大不同！​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 那些曾经遇到的没有分寸感的「同事」、「异性」、「长辈」​，还有「司机」</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 有分寸感的前提是尊重对方是独立个体​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">46:15</a> &nbsp;对不起，你彻底踩到我的分寸感红线了！​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 亲密关系里的分寸感，也太考验人性了​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3665">61:05</a> 在某些情境里，适当挑战分寸感也能拉近距离​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4350">72:30</a> 把握好分寸感，尊重他人意志​</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>/每期可能大差不差的事情如下_.</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播｜页页子 李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>制作｜页页子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>文案｜李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>视觉｜李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>BGM｜Saint Motel - </span><em><span>Puzzle &nbsp;Pieces​</span></em></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Contact｜先评论区联系吧 &nbsp;)</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lisUG_Iyel-ZiLz-_qSQ_X0RBRch.m4a" length="76119656" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk8ZCLJcDV4Gw5XBFmnx7dyTrqlU.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep12. 主播隐私大公开：聊聊亲密关系</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66afb64b33ddcbb53c437b8c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66afb64b33ddcbb53c437b8c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>/这期，两名女主播，深入挖掘了彼此对亲密关系的理解并选择公开。世界破破烂烂，愿大家都能找到你的亲密关系，让彼此可以缝缝补补_.</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/本期你将听到如下内容_.</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 你的亲密关系网里，都有哪些人？​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 亲情、友情、爱情，我都很难建立亲密关系​欸</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 所以，你觉得什么是亲密关系？​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 囤囤最近一次接近亲密关系的瞬间</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 对他人好奇，是建立亲密关系的开始​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 人与人之间“过过事儿”很重要​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 「回避型人格」的我，真就建立不来亲密关系！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 好的亲密关系深深滋养着我​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3012">50:12</a> 那些历史人物，也成为了我的亲密朋友​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3800">63:20</a> 期待“找到彼此，感受彼此，看到彼此”的亲密关系</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>另附上我们聊到的电影《白日梦想家》，里面出现的那段metto：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj69PT9fTN-fuPVCSwnJjeNEQWJs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>/每期可能大差不差的事情如下_.</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播｜页页子 李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>制作｜页页子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>文案｜李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>视觉｜李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>BGM｜</span><em><span>I</span></em><span> </span><em><span>Feel</span></em><span> You - </span><em><span>洪大光</span></em><span> (홍대광) (韩剧《没关系是爱情啊》OST)</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Contact｜先评论区联系吧 &nbsp;)</span></blockquote>]]></description>
