    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a2096533ddcbb53c006d92</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>前情提要：本期内容录制完之后，《抓娃娃》热搜霸榜，其实都在探讨一个问题：没苦硬吃、有福不享到底有没有必要。看看本期有哪些片段是你感兴趣的吧！​</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/本期你将听到如下内容_.</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 网友和我们贡献的「没苦硬吃」名场面​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 我妈好东西都存着，说要给我当嫁妆​（？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> 给家里买的戴森，成为了客厅装饰品​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 公交车能到的地方，咱绝不选择打车​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1623">27:03</a> &nbsp;没苦吃？「人造苦」了解一下​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">41:50</a> 吃苦成为了安全感的来源？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> 人生漫漫，学会体验并享受就够了！</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>/每期可能大差不差的事情如下_.</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播｜页页子 李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>制作｜页页子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>文案｜李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>视觉｜李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>BGM｜Fa La Fa Lee_Sparks</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Contact｜先评论区联系吧 &nbsp;)</span></blockquote>]]></description>
