    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>历经3个多月，完形填空已经录到第十期啦！先给自己鼓个掌👏🏻​</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>感谢守护我们的115个订阅人！为了你们，我们会再坚持30期的，加油！​</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/本期你将听到如下内容_.</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">000:50</a> 对不起，但最近真的好懒啊！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 赖床、犯懒、迟到，对「床」的爱从小学、初高中延续到现在！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 从赖床到拖延——J人莫名的「责任心」，让我们「拖延」了但没完全拖延</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 放大了事情的难度和实现成本，可能是拖延的原罪</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 两位主播开始立flag了，30期，指日可待！​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a> 不再刻意追求完美，能让行动力翻倍！​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2660">44:20</a> 悲观者正确，乐观者前行​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2954">49:14</a> 对床爱的深沉，但也得先爬起来再说！</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>/每期可能大差不差的事情如下_.</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播｜页页子 李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>制作｜页页子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>文案｜李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>视觉｜李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>BGM｜Fa La Fa Lee_Sparks</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Contact｜先评论区联系吧 &nbsp;)</span></blockquote>]]></description>
