  <item>
    <title>Ep9. 不爱Say No的我，该如何优雅Say No❌？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668fa82437236c546e6ca7f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668fa82437236c546e6ca7f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jul 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>/本期你将听到如下内容_.</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 欢迎第一任飞行嘉宾：可爱的Claire Mo 克莱尔小姐来做客​！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 你是个容易say no的人吗？​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 这样的邀请，我也很难拒绝​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> &nbsp;我拒绝了，但你感受到了吗？​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 勉勉强强答应了别人，结果是自找不痛快​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 拒绝了TA，我后怕了……​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 我反而希望别人能对我直接say no​！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 比起满足我的邀请，对方真正快乐更重要​！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 最「别致」的拒绝是 沉默​</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a> 需求被克莱尔过分满足，我都心虚了…</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>/每期可能大差不差的事情如下_.</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播｜页页子 李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>制作｜页页子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>文案｜李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>视觉｜李囤囤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>BGM｜Fa La Fa Lee_Sparks</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Contact｜先评论区联系吧 &nbsp;)</span></blockquote>]]></description>
